{%- comment -%} PanER · Изтегляния / Сертификати (каталози, технически листове, сертификати) {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="paner-page page-width">
  <nav class="paner-crumbs" aria-label="Навигация">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Начало</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">{{ page.title | default: section.settings.heading }}</span>
  </nav>
  <div class="paner-col__head">
    <div>
      <h1 class="paner-col__title">{{ page.title | default: section.settings.heading }}</h1>
      {%- if page.content != blank -%}<div class="paner-col__desc rte">{{ page.content }}</div>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- assign groups = '' -%}
  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    {%- unless groups contains block.settings.group -%}
      {%- assign groups = groups | append: block.settings.group | append: '|' -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign group_list = groups | split: '|' -%}

  {%- for g in group_list -%}
    <section class="paner-catgroup">
      {%- if g != blank -%}<h2 class="paner-catgroup__title">{{ g }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
      <ul class="paner-files" role="list">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.settings.group != g -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign href = block.settings.url
            if block.settings.file_url != blank
              assign href = block.settings.file_url
            endif
          -%}
          <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <a class="paner-file" href="{{ href | default: '#' }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="paner-file__ic" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h8l5 5v13H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/></svg>
                <small>{{ block.settings.format }}</small>
              </span>
              <span class="paner-file__body">
                <b>{{ block.settings.title }}</b>
                {%- if block.settings.description != blank -%}<span>{{ block.settings.description }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="paner-file__dl">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v11m0 0-4-4m4 4 4-4M5 20h14"/></svg>
                Изтегли
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- if section.blocks.size == 0 -%}
    <div class="paner-empty"><p>Добавете файлове от редактора: секция „PanER · Изтегляния“ → Добави файл.</p></div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PanER · Изтегляния",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Заглавие (ако страницата няма)", "default": "Изтегляния" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Качете PDF файловете в Content → Files и поставете линка им в полето „Линк към файла“." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "file",
      "name": "Файл",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "group", "label": "Група", "default": "Каталози" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Заглавие", "default": "Каталог крепежни елементи 2026" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "description", "label": "Описание", "default": "PDF · всички норми и размери" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "format", "label": "Формат", "default": "PDF" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "file_url", "label": "Линк към файла (от Content → Files)" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "url", "label": "или линк към страница" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "PanER · Изтегляния" } ]
}
{% endschema %}
